@startuml agentic-system-execution-boundary
title Agentic System Execution Boundary ; per ADR-ES-025 section 4 + CR-ES-025 section 4

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic System" as ASys

class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Context" as Ctx
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Escalation" as Esc

ASys --> Auth : operates-within
ASys --> Pol : governed-by
ASys --> Con : constrained-by
ASys --> Ctx : operates-within
ASys --> Gov : operates-under
ASys --> Esc : escalates-to

note bottom of ASys
  Per ADR-ES-025 section 4 + CR-ES-025 section 4 ;
  materiality gate requires delegated-intent
  interpretation, contextual decision selection,
  dynamic action selection, action coordination,
  adaptive response, outcome-oriented execution,
  exception handling, contextual escalation.
end note

@enduml
